ScalarLens reproduction package

This distribution includes FuxiCTR 2.3.10 and model definitions derived from
FuxiCTR, under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Their original copyright
notices are retained in source files and reproduction/licenses.

The private scalarlens._legacy namespace contains the executed research
implementation snapshot for provenance, reference methods and exact regression
tests. Historical names are preserved only for compatibility. Public APIs use
ScalarLens naming. Original datasets and model checkpoints are not distributed.

